774
00:32:35,855 --> 00:32:37,523
Find that mummy!

775
00:32:37,557 --> 00:32:40,158
Sounds like an Abbott and
Castelo movie.

776
00:32:40,192 --> 00:32:41,793
Hey, scrubbing bubbles!

777
00:32:41,827 --> 00:32:43,897
